<section style="padding:4rem 0;">
  <div class="container" style="text-align:center;">
    <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.4rem,2.5vw,2rem);font-weight:300;color:#fff;margin-bottom:1rem;">Ready to Work with Certified Clothing Manufacturers?</h2>
    <p style="color:#FFFFFF;max-width:440px;margin:0 auto 2rem;line-height:1.8;font-size:0.9rem;">Free quote within 48 hours. Obligation-free consultation. MOQ 300 pieces.</p>
